WEBVTT
NOTE SYNC_TYPE: HUMAN_VERIFIED
NOTE Track: 1-14 - Stewart Street
NOTE Artist: The Paper Wall
NOTE Album: 2001: Static and Silence (Book 1)

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:55.500
[Instrumental Intro]

00:00:56.062 --> 00:01:00.200
Four days gone, the engine sighs

00:01:00.300 --> 00:01:05.500
But there's no mercy in my eyes

00:01:05.600 --> 00:01:09.800
My body screams it's morning light

00:01:09.900 --> 00:01:13.698
In this cold and endless rush hour night

00:01:14.658 --> 00:01:19.800
My screen is dark, my phone is dead

00:01:19.900 --> 00:01:25.500
Just static roaring in my head

00:01:25.600 --> 00:01:30.200
A stranger in a strange new town

00:01:30.300 --> 00:01:34.800
As the evening rain comes pouring down

00:01:35.000 --> 00:01:39.800
And I hear the lie in your fake "Surprise!"

00:01:39.900 --> 00:01:44.500
Reflected in the payphone's hollow eyes

00:01:44.600 --> 00:01:49.500
You never told her we were on our way

00:01:49.600 --> 00:01:53.500
You just decided you would stay

00:01:53.600 --> 00:01:58.200
And now I know I'll never see

00:01:58.300 --> 00:02:03.200
The home that's waiting back for me

00:02:03.300 --> 00:02:06.394
This is the end, my final plea

00:02:06.434 --> 00:02:11.058
Lost on this rainy Stewart Street

00:02:23.958 --> 00:02:28.500
I hear you talk of "traffic jams"

00:02:28.600 --> 00:02:33.500
Of "sudden trips" and altered plans

00:02:33.600 --> 00:02:38.500
Your voice is sweet, a sugar shell

00:02:38.600 --> 00:02:43.103
Hiding the keys to my new hell

00:02:43.383 --> 00:02:48.500
The number one-five-oh you say

00:02:48.600 --> 00:02:52.388
Another bus to take me away

00:02:52.468 --> 00:02:56.800
Not closer home, but to the cage

00:02:56.900 --> 00:03:02.500
You've built with your own bitter rage

00:03:02.800 --> 00:03:07.800
And I hear the lie in your fake "Surprise!"

